{"3969490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Axiomatik", "steam_appid": 3969490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4890860], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dark. You’re a robot with a low battery level – frantically looking for a charging station before your time runs out and you shut down. The only way you can see in the dark is by using your light gun to shoot bouncing balls that leave neon glowing stripes which reveal the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/4d87aaf2626e0832ca4bffd73cbf48b4.poster.avif?t=1787924415\" aria-label=\"A weapon held in VR is shooting into the darkness \" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/4d87aaf2626e0832ca4bffd73cbf48b4.webm?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/4d87aaf2626e0832ca4bffd73cbf48b4.mp4?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot to see until you run out of bullets. Your only enemy: time. If you fail, you will reboot. Repeat until you succeed to unlock the next level. Find cute cat companions (dead or alive) along the way and determine their fate by encountering the famous quantum physics thought experiment: to open Schroedinger's box or not to open? Care for your cats by keeping them fed and making sure they don’t get lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/0b5f843a330da9c2aa4b0124a93a6aeb.poster.avif?t=1787924415\" aria-label=\"A robot hand holding an animated ticket in an elevator\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/0b5f843a330da9c2aa4b0124a93a6aeb.webm?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/0b5f843a330da9c2aa4b0124a93a6aeb.mp4?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve increasingly complex spatial puzzles, experience wave-particle teleporter and relativistic time pickups - don't you worry: they are a mystery to everyone. Compete against other players on a worldwide leader board to see who can beat the levels in the quickest times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axiomatik brings elements of classic Arcade games into VR – neon graphics against black background and 8-bit synth sounds – with modern platforming and controls.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dark. You’re a robot with a low battery level – frantically looking for a charging station before your time runs out and you shut down. The only way you can see in the dark is by using your light gun to shoot bouncing balls that leave neon glowing stripes which reveal the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/4d87aaf2626e0832ca4bffd73cbf48b4.poster.avif?t=1787924415\" aria-label=\"A weapon held in VR is shooting into the darkness \" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/4d87aaf2626e0832ca4bffd73cbf48b4.webm?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/4d87aaf2626e0832ca4bffd73cbf48b4.mp4?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot to see until you run out of bullets. Your only enemy: time. If you fail, you will reboot. Repeat until you succeed to unlock the next level. Find cute cat companions (dead or alive) along the way and determine their fate by encountering the famous quantum physics thought experiment: to open Schroedinger's box or not to open? Care for your cats by keeping them fed and making sure they don’t get lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/0b5f843a330da9c2aa4b0124a93a6aeb.poster.avif?t=1787924415\" aria-label=\"A robot hand holding an animated ticket in an elevator\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/0b5f843a330da9c2aa4b0124a93a6aeb.webm?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/extras/0b5f843a330da9c2aa4b0124a93a6aeb.mp4?t=1787924415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve increasingly complex spatial puzzles, experience wave-particle teleporter and relativistic time pickups - don't you worry: they are a mystery to everyone. Compete against other players on a worldwide leader board to see who can beat the levels in the quickest times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axiomatik brings elements of classic Arcade games into VR – neon graphics against black background and 8-bit synth sounds – with modern platforming and controls.</p>", "short_description": "Squeaky colored VR arcade platformer. Beat the clock as a robot with a draining battery. Crazy new Shoot-2-See! mechanic: Find your way i